#
# May this switch change now (warren_rules.h WR2), in Sutra. Only in the
# owner's session (owner 1); and a change that turns a regulated engine
# on (regulated 1, enable 1) only with the owner's approval (approved 1).
# Turning an engine off, or a plain one on, needs only the owner. Each is
# a one-digit flag: 2..9 is no flag, never a yes; a negative one does not
# fit its picture: refused.
record switch-change
  owner: 9
  regulated: 9
  approved: 9
  enable: 9
procedure
  if owner = 1
    answer regulated = 0 or enable = 0 or approved = 1
  end-if
  answer 0 = 1
